      "Pick a license, enter the **copyright holder** and **year**, and the tool generates a ready-to-ship **LICENSE** file you can **copy** or **download** (full texts for **MIT**, **ISC** and **BSD-3-Clause**; official header notices plus authoritative links for the longer documents). Everything runs **fully in your browser** and it is **free** to try (heavy repeated use may ask for **Pro**). This is **not legal advice**: for real projects with revenue or contributors, talk to a lawyer."
