      "**IconVault**'s **Percentage Calculator** handles the three percentage questions people actually ask, with **live results** as you type. **X% of Y** finds a share of a value, **X is what % of Y** turns a part and whole into a percent, and **Percent change** shows increase or decrease between an old and a new value with the direction labeled.",
